{
 "esm": "1.3.0",
 "metadata": {
  "name": "mom6_eos",
  "description": "Stage-2 implementation of the MOM6 equation of state (stage 1 boundary B1 of stage1/runs/MOM6_LANE.md; MOM6 dev/ncar_260909 @301879336, fork stage1/EqESM-cesm-mom6 branch instrument/mom6-dumps): the Wright 1997 full-range in-situ density rho(T, S, p) and its analytic first derivatives drho/dT, drho/dS, as evaluated by the model's calculate_density / calculate_density_derivs_scalar calls in KPP_compute_BLD (MOM_CVMix_KPP.F90:1437; the EOS law itself is density_elem_Wright_full / calculate_density_derivs_elem_Wright_full, MOM_EOS_Wright_full.F90:75-91 / 179-204). The model WrightEOS binds the 15 Fortran coefficients by reference from the wright_coeff_a0..c5 constant fragments of ./mom6_templates.esm (MOM_EOS_Wright_full.F90:23-37; the fragments are the single shared source of the coefficient values, also used by the wright_rho composition and by the KPPBLD model of mom6_kpp.esm), computes the three shared polynomials al0/p0/lambda as intermediate unknowns via the wright_alpha0/wright_p0/wright_lambda templates of ./mom6_templates.esm, then rho = (p + p0)/(lambda + al0*(p + p0)) via the wright_density template and the Fortran's hand-coded derivative formulas (wright_drho_dT / wright_drho_dS templates) with the shared denominator inverse I_denom2 = 1/(lambda + al0*(p + p0))^2 (F90:198). The derivatives are transcribed formulas, NOT symbolic D(rho, T)/D(rho, S): in esm 1.3.0 the D operator is a rewrite-target for discretization stencils (esm-spec 4.2 / 9.6.8) and the CLI 0.7.0 evaluator rejects it for algebraic expressions ('unlowered_operator ... reached evaluation without being lowered to a stencil'), so the Fortran derivative formulas are reproduced exactly instead (operation order identical to the Fortran, so the tests pin the derivative columns to round-off, rel 1e-12). State units: T potential temperature [degC], S salinity [ppt], p pressure at the top interface of the layer [Pa] (surface pressure + hydrostatic weight of the layers above, MOM_CVMix_KPP.F90:1428-1440), rho in-situ density [kg m-3], drho/dT [kg m-3 degC-1], drho/dS [kg m-3 ppt-1]. The run configuration (C_JRA_t62_mom6_inst) uses EQN_OF_STATE = WRIGHT_FULL (the MOM6 default), USE_PSURF_IN_EOS = True, and all unit rescale factors 1.0, so the dumped values are the physical-unit law values.",
  "authors": [
   "EqESM stage 2 (wt/mom6-eos)"
  ]
 },
 "models": {
  "WrightEOS": {
   "expression_template_imports": [
    { "ref": "./mom6_templates.esm" }
   ],
   "variables": {
    "T": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "degC",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "Potential temperature relative to the surface (the dumped T column), [degC]"
    },
    "S": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "ppt",
     "default": 35.0,
     "description": "Salinity (the dumped S column), [ppt]"
    },
    "p": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "Pa",
     "default": 100000.0,
     "description": "Pressure at the top interface of the layer: surface pressure plus the hydrostatic weight of the layers above (MOM_CVMix_KPP.F90:1428-1440), [Pa]"
    },
    "al0": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m^3/kg",
     "description": "The specific volume at zero pressure offset in the Wright EOS (al0, MOM_EOS_Wright_full.F90:82), [m3 kg-1]"
    },
    "p0": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "Pa",
     "description": "The pressure offset in the Wright EOS (p0, MOM_EOS_Wright_full.F90:83), [Pa]"
    },
    "lam": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m^2/s^2",
     "description": "The sound speed squared at zero alpha offset in the Wright EOS (lambda, MOM_EOS_Wright_full.F90:84), [m2 s-2]"
    },
    "I_denom2": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "s^4/m^4",
     "description": "The inverse of the square of the denominator of density in the Wright EOS, 1/(lambda + al0*(p + p0))^2 (MOM_EOS_Wright_full.F90:192, 198), [s4 m-4]"
    },
    "rho": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "kg/m^3",
     "description": "In-situ density of sea water (density_elem_Wright_full, MOM_EOS_Wright_full.F90:75-91), [kg m-3]"
    },
    "drho_dT": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "kg/m^3/degC",
     "description": "The partial derivative of density with potential temperature (calculate_density_derivs_elem_Wright_full, MOM_EOS_Wright_full.F90:184-185, 199-200), [kg m-3 degC-1]"
    },
    "drho_dS": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "kg/m^3/ppt",
     "description": "The partial derivative of density with salinity (calculate_density_derivs_elem_Wright_full, MOM_EOS_Wright_full.F90:186-187, 201-202), [kg m-3 PSU-1]"
    }
   },
   "equations": [
    {
     "lhs": "al0",
     "rhs": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "wright_alpha0",
       "bindings": {
        "a0": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "wright_coeff_a0", "bindings": {} },
        "a1": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "wright_coeff_a1", "bindings": {} },
        "a2": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "wright_coeff_a2", "bindings": {} },
        "T": "T", "S": "S" } }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "p0",
     "rhs": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "wright_p0",
       "bindings": {
        "b0": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "wright_coeff_b0", "bindings": {} },
        "b1": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "wright_coeff_b1", "bindings": {} },
        "b2": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "wright_coeff_b2", "bindings": {} },
        "b3": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "wright_coeff_b3", "bindings": {} },
        "b4": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "wright_coeff_b4", "bindings": {} },
        "b5": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "wright_coeff_b5", "bindings": {} },
        "T": "T", "S": "S" } }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "lam",
     "rhs": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "wright_lambda",
       "bindings": {
        "c0": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "wright_coeff_c0", "bindings": {} },
        "c1": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "wright_coeff_c1", "bindings": {} },
        "c2": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "wright_coeff_c2", "bindings": {} },
        "c3": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "wright_coeff_c3", "bindings": {} },
        "c4": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "wright_coeff_c4", "bindings": {} },
        "c5": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "wright_coeff_c5", "bindings": {} },
        "T": "T", "S": "S" } }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "rho",
     "rhs": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "wright_density",
       "bindings": { "p": "p", "p0": "p0", "al0": "al0", "lambda": "lam" } }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "I_denom2",
     "rhs": { "op": "/", "args": [
       1.0,
       { "op": "^", "args": [
         { "op": "+", "args": [
           "lam",
           { "op": "*", "args": ["al0", { "op": "+", "args": ["p", "p0"] }] } ] },
         2 ] } ] }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "drho_dT",
     "rhs": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "wright_drho_dT",
       "bindings": { "T": "T", "S": "S", "p": "p", "p0": "p0", "lambda": "lam", "I_denom2": "I_denom2",
         "a1": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "wright_coeff_a1", "bindings": {} },
         "b1": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "wright_coeff_b1", "bindings": {} },
         "b2": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "wright_coeff_b2", "bindings": {} },
         "b3": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "wright_coeff_b3", "bindings": {} },
         "b5": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "wright_coeff_b5", "bindings": {} },
         "c1": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "wright_coeff_c1", "bindings": {} },
         "c2": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "wright_coeff_c2", "bindings": {} },
         "c3": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "wright_coeff_c3", "bindings": {} },
         "c5": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "wright_coeff_c5", "bindings": {} } } }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "drho_dS",
     "rhs": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "wright_drho_dS",
       "bindings": { "T": "T", "S": "S", "p": "p", "p0": "p0", "lambda": "lam", "I_denom2": "I_denom2",
         "a2": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "wright_coeff_a2", "bindings": {} },
         "b4": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "wright_coeff_b4", "bindings": {} },
         "b5": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "wright_coeff_b5", "bindings": {} },
         "c4": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "wright_coeff_c4", "bindings": {} },
         "c5": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "wright_coeff_c5", "bindings": {} } } }
    }
   ],
   "tests": [
    {
     "id": "surface_k1_cell3_78_step1",
     "description": "Instantaneous pin of the WRIGHT_FULL law and its derivatives at the surface layer of traced cell (gi, gj) = (3, 78) on the first thermo step: mom6_eos.csv row (cpl_step 1, gi 3, gj 78, k 1) gives T = 1.9019792708374321 degC, S = 33.59310698272627 ppt, p = 99753.85917574639 Pa (surface pressure; the same p as the surface-forcing dump's p column for this cell), rho = 1026.872408356005 kg m-3, drho/dT = -0.07330861794257675 kg m-3 degC-1, drho/dS = 0.7969321251520414 kg m-3 ppt-1. The coefficients come from the wright_coeff_a0..c5 constant fragments (MOM_EOS_Wright_full.F90:23-37). time_span {0,0} evaluates the algebraic law pointwise; the dump writes es26.17 so the transcription is pinned to round-off (rel 1e-12).",
     "time_span": {"start": 0.0, "end": 0.0},
     "parameter_overrides": {
      "T": 1.9019792708374321,
      "S": 33.59310698272627,
      "p": 99753.85917574639
     },
     "tolerance": {"rel": 1e-12},
     "assertions": [
      {"variable": "rho", "time": 0.0, "expected": 1026.872408356005},
      {"variable": "drho_dT", "time": 0.0, "expected": -0.07330861794257675},
      {"variable": "drho_dS", "time": 0.0, "expected": 0.7969321251520414}
     ]
    },
    {
